---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Latest insights, strategies, and tips for writing viral tweets on X (Twitter). Updated regularly with fresh content.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Blog</h2>
      <p>Practical guides, teardowns, and checklists for writing better posts on X (Twitter).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3>Start With Hooks</h3>
        <p>Learn how to write first lines that create curiosity without overpromising.</p>
        <a href="/blog/5-tweet-hooks-that-stop-the-scroll/" class="tool-link">Read the hook guide →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📈</div>
        <h3>Fix Engagement</h3>
        <p>Diagnose weak topics, unclear formatting, poor timing, and missing conversation paths.</p>
        <a href="/blog/why-your-tweets-arent-getting-engagement-and-how-to-fix-it/" class="tool-link">Run the audit →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🧵</div>
        <h3>Write Better Threads</h3>
        <p>Turn one idea into a structured thread with a clear promise, proof, and takeaway.</p>
        <a href="/blog/twitter-threads-guide/" class="tool-link">Open the thread guide →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="blog-card">
        <div class="blog-card-image">
          {% if post.data.emoji %}{{ post.data.emoji }}{% else %}🚀{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="blog-card-content">
          <div class="blog-card-meta">
            <span>{{ post.date | dateFormat }}</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>{{ post.data.readingTime or '5 min' }} read</span>
          </div>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card-link">
            Read More
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Editorial CTA -->
<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>How Guides Are Reviewed</h2>
      <p>Learn how topics are selected, edited, updated, and corrected.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="btn btn-primary">Read Editorial Policy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
